+    - `PAIR inproc 64B`: `4170.15 Kmsg/s` vs `3176.67 Kmsg/s`, `-23.82%`
+    - `DEALER_DEALER tcp 64B`: `3737.68 Kmsg/s` vs `2801.02 Kmsg/s`, `-25.06%`
+    - `DEALER_DEALER inproc 64B`: `4104.88 Kmsg/s` vs `3294.05 Kmsg/s`, `-19.75%`
